  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Controller Temporary Sol.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Controller temporary sol.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1998 inf&#xf6;rdes det nya redovisningssystemet i Estland och insatsen ber&#xe4;knades avlutas i maj 1999. Pga flera faktorer har dock systemet fortarande inte utvecklats till fullo. D&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r avser den kommande perioden r&#xe5;dgivning (f&#xf6;r bokslutet 98 99) , projektkontroll och en workshop som uppf&#xf6;ljning p&#xe5; analyserna f&#xf6;r projektgruppen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new accounting system was introduced in Estonia in 1998. Due to several reasons a full fledged system is not yet achieved. Hence, an advisinggroup and controller is assisting the Ministry of Finance to reach its objectiv with a balance for 1998,1999 and 2000. Extra time and resources for advise and analysis until 6/2000.</narrative>
  </description>
